    },
    {
        "text": "00:38 A.M. \\ Dusty"
    },
    {
        "text": "Downtown Lungmen, Plaza, Outdoor Party"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We followed the directions all the way but why is... is that a block party?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Check out that candle! It's huge!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Settle down, Exusiai.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "The air smells so sickly sweet, I feel like I want to puke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmm... we oughta get ourselves a booth here next time. I bet we'd make a bundle!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#4",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Texas, have you heard from the boss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#4",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not yet. He's probably passed out drunk somewhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exusiai, can you get this thing off my head?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks to this stupid light on my head, I don't get to wear big fun party hats like that. I'm so jealous!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#3",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What happens if you try to force a hat on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I get a feeling that's something like waking up hungover to find I'm in the passenger seat of a car driven by a very emotionally charged Texas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that don't sound like a good time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#4",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#8",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So you've tried that before...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "So where's the boss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's so many people here, if the enemy chases us this way, they'll get all mixed up with the civilians...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_243_waaifu_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Penguin Logistics.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And you're... the girl from the detective agency...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And this guy here with you is that infamous knife-wielding helmsman from the docks?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What? No. That's the craziest version I've heard yet...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just a typical hawker. Oh! Tonight I'm a part-time finball master.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And you must be Texas?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Something happened tonight. Don't act like you don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Waai Fu, you don't have to be so aggressive with them. They're just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I know. But it's ridiculous how many times this has happened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine as long as you don't get anyone else mixed up in this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "But when it comes to getting innocent people hurt, causing so much damage to their property, can't you think like honest, law-abiding citizens for once?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Nothin' we can say to that.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...So what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So we must correct your deficient character.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Th- there's no need to come to blows here. We know we've made a lot of trouble for a lot of people tonight, but we can talk this out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#3",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Texas?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me say this first: everything that's happened tonight is completely baffling and inexplicable, and also completely exhausting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "So let's just say I'm not in a great mood right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "You hear what I'm saying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1#4",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "One on one. If I win, you guys follow the rules to the letter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "...for at least one month.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Just a month?!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And if I win, then you and all your goldbricking busybodies have to mind your own damned business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Fair's fair... But I won't go easy on you. Get ready!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
