        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh. How did we come to this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on! Both of you, calm down! You can't just have a fistfight in the middle of the...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Woah! Kung fu! Sick!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunk"
    },
    {
        "text": "The wolf's not going down easy. C'mon! Look out behind you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunk"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been a long time since I saw Yan kung fu this good! Show us some more!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't a show!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get her, Texas!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch your leg! It's a feint!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't have to join in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_243_waaifu_1#3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
