    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "*crackle*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Attention! All good citizens attending the Sauin celebration!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunk"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's up? What's that guy doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you hear me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! You're too loud!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aight. Great. You can hear me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, everybody, quiet down! Quiet down please!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lend me your ears. And bow before me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$emperor_intro",
        "key": "$emperor_loop",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's this guy's deal?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait a minute, that's Emperor! From Monster Siren Records! C'mon!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shouldn't he be in Columbia?! What's he doing in Lungmen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Drunk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is Mr. Emperor... doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "The boss always does this music producer thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_101_sora_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean, he is a music producer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sora"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Our operating capital ain't just from the logistics business. The baws's got all kinds of revenue streams. Like...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Like what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Nah. Never mind. Prob'ly best not to say too much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
